title: How a pull request lands
---
%% Source of examples/pull-request.json:
%%   node cli/motion-kit.mjs import examples/pull-request.mmd --out examples/pull-request.json
flowchart TD
  accDescr: A pull request runs CI and review; a failed build or requested changes loop back until it merges and is released.
  open([Open a PR]) --> ci{CI passes?}
  ci -- No --> fix[Fix the build]
  fix --> ci
  ci -- Yes --> review{Approved?}
  review -->|Changes| revise[Revise]
  revise --> review
  review -->|Yes| merge[Merge]
  merge --> release([Release])
